"char_end": 159,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s02"
},
{
"start": 7.803,
"end": 9.946,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Chiara Ricci, thank you for being here.",
"char_start": 160,
"char_end": 199,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s03"
},
{
"start": 9.946,
"end": 11.139,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Thank you, Giulia.",
"char_start": 214,
"char_end": 232,
"unit_id": "t0001.u01",
"sent_id": "t0001.s01"
},
{
"start": 11.139,
"end": 13.261,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "It's good to be back here again.",
"char_start": 233,
"char_end": 265,
"unit_id": "t0001.u01",
"sent_id": "t0001.s02"
},
{
"start": 13.261,
"end": 15.698,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "This episode is sponsored by Linear.",
"char_start": 282,
"char_end": 318,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s01"
},
{
"start": 15.698,
"end": 20.571,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Linear is the issue tracker designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 319,
"char_end": 391,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 20.571,
"end": 21.992,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Try linear.com today.",
"char_start": 392,
"char_end": 413,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 21.992,
"end": 30.975,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Before we get into the details, Marco Bellini was a guest on the show and mentioned that drainage is the design choice with the biggest impact.",
"char_start": 414,
"char_end": 557,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 30.975,
"end": 32.042,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Yes, that's correct.",
"char_start": 572,
"char_end": 592,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 32.042,
"end": 34.657,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "And that connects to what we're discussing today.",
"char_start": 593,
"char_end": 642,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 34.657,
"end": 40.628,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "I want to point out something – Marco Bellini mentioned the same issue a couple of episodes ago.",
"char_start": 659,
"char_end": 755,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 40.628,
"end": 42.86,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Can you give me a specific example?",
"char_start": 756,
"char_end": 791,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 42.86,
"end": 45.984,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 792,
"char_end": 841,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 45.984,
"end": 51.599,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Honestly, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 856,
"char_end": 948,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 51.599,
"end": 54.223,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 949,
"char_end": 992,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 54.223,
"end": 58.434,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 993,
"char_end": 1062,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 58.434,
"end": 60.256,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into this.",
"char_start": 1079,
"char_end": 1112,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 60.256,
"end": 63.016,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1113,
"char_end": 1163,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 63.016,
"end": 63.624,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 1178,
"char_end": 1188,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 63.624,
"end": 69.885,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than minor adjustments to the suspension.",
"char_start": 1189,
"char_end": 1292,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 69.885,
"end": 74.627,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "The framing is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 1293,
"char_end": 1371,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 74.627,
"end": 75.964,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Let's start from there.",
"char_start": 1388,
"char_end": 1411,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 75.964,
"end": 78.871,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1412,
"char_end": 1462,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 78.871,
"end": 85.643,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Honestly, risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes – it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 1477,
"char_end": 1593,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 85.643,
"end": 88.095,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano.",
"char_start": 1594,
"char_end": 1636,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 88.095,
"end": 92.999,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "If you ignore it, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1637,
"char_end": 1721,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 92.999,
"end": 94.644,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where does it stop working?",
"char_start": 1738,
"char_end": 1765,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 94.644,
"end": 99.289,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this becomes particularly clear.",
"char_start": 1780,
"char_end": 1864,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 99.289,
"end": 103.215,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1865,
"char_end": 1936,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 103.215,
"end": 106.231,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always find yourself using?",
"char_start": 1953,
"char_end": 2011,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 106.231,
"end": 108.623,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 2012,
"char_end": 2058,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 108.623,
"end": 109.763,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 2073,
"char_end": 2093,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 109.763,
"end": 116.948,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the race track sections change the choice of trajectory between practice runs and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 2094,
"char_end": 2220,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 116.948,
"end": 120.769,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 2221,
"char_end": 2288,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 120.769,
"end": 126.204,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Before we continue, support the program by visiting the website of our sponsor.",
"char_start": 2305,
"char_end": 2384,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s01"
},
{
"start": 126.204,
"end": 128.337,
