"start": 283.316,
"end": 286.165,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "I'm giving you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 5262,
"char_end": 5313,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 286.165,
"end": 292.031,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 5314,
"char_end": 5419,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 292.031,
"end": 294.768,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 5420,
"char_end": 5469,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 294.768,
"end": 298.232,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5470,
"char_end": 5532,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s04"
},
{
"start": 298.232,
"end": 298.732,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Come back.",
"char_start": 5549,
"char_end": 5559,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 298.732,
"end": 307.572,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within that workflow, the trade-off becomes apparent – I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5574,
"char_end": 5727,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 307.572,
"end": 310.375,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always find yourself using?",
"char_start": 5744,
"char_end": 5802,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 310.375,
"end": 312.84,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the most important aspect of this question?",
"char_start": 5803,
"char_end": 5854,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 312.84,
"end": 313.828,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 5869,
"char_end": 5889,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 313.828,
"end": 320.202,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the race track sections influence the choice of trajectory between practice runs and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 5890,
"char_end": 6019,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 320.202,
"end": 323.611,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 6020,
"char_end": 6089,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s03"
},
{
"start": 323.611,
"end": 328.737,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
"char_start": 6106,
"char_end": 6174,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 328.737,
"end": 332.827,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we've discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 6189,
"char_end": 6260,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 332.827,
"end": 334.497,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Everything else is iteration.",
"char_start": 6261,
"char_end": 6290,
